Description: Efficiently read and write Waveform (WAV) audio files <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/WAV>. 
  Support for unsigned 8 bit Pulse-code modulation (PCM), signed 12, 16, 24 and 32 bit 
  PCM and other encodings.  
